Scope

This license covers the files in this repository except vendor/.

- vendor/vscode-git-graph-rs is a git submodule pointing at
  https://github.com/neophack/vscode-git-graph-rs, under its own licenses. Only its
  Rust engine (native/, MIT, "Copyright (c) 2026 penghongxia") is built into the app
  and the remote helper. Its other parts - the webview and extension host layers
  (web/, src/ and the compiled out/, media/), which derive from Git Graph by mhutchie
  and are under the Git Graph license - are neither used by this project nor part of
  any build of it.

- Builds of the app (.app, .dmg) and of its remote helper (gg-remote) consist of this
  project's own code, that engine, and the open-source packages listed in
  THIRD-PARTY.md, each under the license given there. They may be distributed under
  this license and those packages' licenses. THIRD-PARTY.md carries the copyright and
  license notices those licenses ask for, and every build includes it (with this file)
  in the app's Contents/Resources.
